  <section id="vs-prq" class="scroll-mt-20 bg-white">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-16">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 text-center">Ecommerce quiz vs product recommendation quiz</h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-3xl text-slate-700 text-center">
        These two terms get used interchangeably and they shouldn't be. The relationship is <strong>hierarchical</strong>: a product recommendation quiz is one <strong>type</strong> of ecommerce quiz, but the category includes other formats that aren't built to recommend a SKU.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-10">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 1200 720" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-labelledby="hierarchy-title" style="width:100%;height:auto;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,sans-serif;background:#16161D;border-radius:16px;padding:28px 16px;box-sizing:border-box;">
          <title id="hierarchy-title">Product recommendation quiz is one type of ecommerce quiz</title>
          <defs><linearGradient id="rh-grad-hier" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#6464ff"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#4bd5ff"/></linearGradient></defs>
          <text x="600" y="58" text-anchor="middle" fill="#F5F7FA" font-size="30" font-weight="800" letter-spacing="-0.5">Where a product recommendation quiz sits inside the category</text>
          <rect x="30" y="100" width="1140" height="600" rx="20" fill="rgba(90,178,255,0.05)" stroke="rgba(90,178,255,0.45)" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="6 6"/>
          <text x="60" y="142" fill="#5AB2FF" font-size="17" font-weight="800" letter-spacing="2">ECOMMERCE QUIZ (CATEGORY)</text>
          <g><rect x="60" y="180" width="210" height="500" rx="14" fill="rgba(90,178,255,0.14)" stroke="rgba(90,178,255,0.55)" stroke-width="1.5"/><text x="165" y="235" text-anchor="middle" fill="#F5F7FA" font-size="20" font-weight="800"><tspan x="165" dy="0">1. Product</tspan><tspan x="165" dy="28">recommendation</tspan></text><line x1="80" y1="305" x2="250" y2="305" stroke="rgba(90,178,255,0.35)" stroke-width="1"/><text x="165" y="360" text-anchor="middle" fill="#A7AFBF" font-size="17"><tspan x="165" dy="0">Match SKUs to needs.</tspan><tspan x="165" dy="24">Voting, scoring,</tspan><tspan x="165" dy="24">or fixed lists.</tspan></text><rect x="75" y="570" width="180" height="90" rx="10" fill="url(#rh-grad-hier)"/><text x="165" y="600" text-anchor="middle" fill="#F5F7FA" font-size="14" font-weight="800" letter-spacing="1">= PRODUCT</text><text x="165" y="624" text-anchor="middle" fill="#F5F7FA" font-size="14" font-weight="800" letter-spacing="1">RECOMMENDATION</text><text x="165" y="648" text-anchor="middle" fill="#F5F7FA" font-size="14" font-weight="800" letter-spacing="1">QUIZ</text></g>
          <g><rect x="285" y="180" width="210" height="500" rx="14" fill="#1F1F29" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.10)" stroke-width="1"/><text x="390" y="235" text-anchor="middle" fill="#F5F7FA" font-size="20" font-weight="800"><tspan x="390" dy="0">2. Personality /</tspan><tspan x="390" dy="28">archetype</tspan></text><line x1="305" y1="305" x2="475" y2="305" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.10)" stroke-width="1"/><text x="390" y="360" text-anchor="middle" fill="#A7AFBF" font-size="17"><tspan x="390" dy="0">Dosha, hair, style.</tspan><tspan x="390" dy="24">Result is a label.</tspan></text><text x="390" y="540" text-anchor="middle" fill="#9CA3AF" font-size="15" font-style="italic"><tspan x="390" dy="0">recommends a SKU</tspan><tspan x="390" dy="22">only if you route</tspan><tspan x="390" dy="22">to a product set</tspan></text></g>
          <g><rect x="510" y="180" width="210" height="500" rx="14" fill="#1F1F29" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.10)" stroke-width="1"/><text x="615" y="235" text-anchor="middle" fill="#F5F7FA" font-size="20" font-weight="800"><tspan x="615" dy="0">3. Diagnostic</tspan><tspan x="615" dy="28">(routine)</tspan></text><line x1="530" y1="305" x2="700" y2="305" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.10)" stroke-width="1"/><text x="615" y="360" text-anchor="middle" fill="#A7AFBF" font-size="17"><tspan x="615" dy="0">Skincare, haircare.</tspan><tspan x="615" dy="24">Result is a routine.</tspan></text><text x="615" y="540" text-anchor="middle" fill="#9CA3AF" font-size="15" font-style="italic"><tspan x="615" dy="0">overlaps with PRQ</tspan><tspan x="615" dy="22">when the routine is</tspan><tspan x="615" dy="22">a bundle of SKUs</tspan></text></g>
          <g><rect x="735" y="180" width="210" height="500" rx="14" fill="#1F1F29" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.10)" stroke-width="1"/><text x="840" y="253" text-anchor="middle" fill="#F5F7FA" font-size="20" font-weight="800">4. Gift finder</text><line x1="755" y1="305" x2="925" y2="305" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.10)" stroke-width="1"/><text x="840" y="360" text-anchor="middle" fill="#A7AFBF" font-size="17"><tspan x="840" dy="0">Recipient-first.</tspan><tspan x="840" dy="24">Curated shortlist.</tspan></text><text x="840" y="540" text-anchor="middle" fill="#9CA3AF" font-size="15" font-style="italic"><tspan x="840" dy="0">PRQ logic applied</tspan><tspan x="840" dy="22">but the customer</tspan><tspan x="840" dy="22">isn't the recipient</tspan></text></g>
          <g><rect x="960" y="180" width="210" height="500" rx="14" fill="#1F1F29" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.10)" stroke-width="1"/><text x="1065" y="235" text-anchor="middle" fill="#F5F7FA" font-size="20" font-weight="800"><tspan x="1065" dy="0">5. Knowledge /</tspan><tspan x="1065" dy="28">assessment</tspan></text><line x1="980" y1="305" x2="1150" y2="305" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.10)" stroke-width="1"/><text x="1065" y="360" text-anchor="middle" fill="#A7AFBF" font-size="17"><tspan x="1065" dy="0">Lead magnet.</tspan><tspan x="1065" dy="24">Report for email.</tspan></text><text x="1065" y="540" text-anchor="middle" fill="#9CA3AF" font-size="15" font-style="italic"><tspan x="1065" dy="0">no SKU on the</tspan><tspan x="1065" dy="22">result page; sale</tspan><tspan x="1065" dy="22">happens via email</tspan></text></g>
        </svg>
        <p class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-3xl text-center text-xs text-slate-500 leading-snug">
          <span class="font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-600">Fig. 04</span> &nbsp;Set diagram: the umbrella term "ecommerce quiz" contains all five types; "product recommendation quiz" is type 1 (and the SKU-recommending halves of types 2 and 3).
        </p>
      </div>

      <p class="mx-auto mt-10 max-w-3xl text-center text-slate-700">
        If your goal is to lift conversion rate and AOV with matched products, you want a product recommendation quiz: the format covered in detail on <a href="/" class="font-medium text-[#16161D] underline decoration-slate-300 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#16161D]">RevenueHunt's product recommendation quiz</a> home page. If your goal is broader (gating a lead magnet, running a brand archetype, building a content quiz), an ecommerce quiz is the right umbrella term and recommendation logic is one piece of it.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Why now -->
  <section class="bg-slate-50">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-16">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 text-center">Why ecommerce quizzes work now</h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-3xl text-slate-700 text-center">
        Three things changed in the last 24 months. The combination means a quiz now <strong>pays back faster</strong> and <strong>depreciates slower</strong> than the same effort spent on a static landing page.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-3">
        {WHY_NOW.map((w, i) => (
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-7">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#616eff]">{String(i + 1).padStart(2, "0")}</p>
            <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">{w.title}</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-700">{w.body}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ -->
  <section class="bg-white">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-16">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 text-center">Frequently asked questions</h2>
      <div class="mt-10 divide-y divide-slate-200 border-y border-slate-200">
        {FAQ.map((f) => (
          <details class="group">
            <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
              <span>{f.question}</span>
              <svg
                class="h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 text-slate-400 transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-180"
                viewBox="0 0 20 20"
                fill="currentColor"
                aria-hidden="true"
              >
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M5.23 7.21a.75.75 0 011.06.02L10 11.17l3.71-3.94a.75.75 0 111.08 1.04l-4.25 4.5a.75.75 0 01-1.08 0l-4.25-4.5a.75.75 0 01.02-1.06z" clip-rule="evenodd"/>
              </svg>
            </summary>
            <p class="pb-5 text-slate-700" set:html={f.answerHtml ?? f.answer} />
          </details>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Bottom CTA -->
  <section class="bg-[#16161D]">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-20 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl">
        Build your first ecommerce quiz this week.
      </h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-lg text-white/70">
        RevenueHunt is free to start, with 100 quiz responses a month. Pick a logic, write five questions, link the catalogue, and ship.
      </p>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-white/60">
        See what a quiz could add to your store with our <a href="/quiz-roi-calculator/" class="font-medium text-white underline decoration-white/40 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-white">quiz ROI calculator</a> or read the full <a href="/state-of-product-recommendation-quizzes/" class="font-medium text-white underline decoration-white/40 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-white">benchmark report on 45M+ responses</a>.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col justify-center gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:flex-wrap">
        <a
          href={SHOPIFY_INSTALL}
          target="_blank"
          rel="external noopener nofollow"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-white px-6 py-3 text-base font-semibold text-[#16161D] transition hover:bg-slate-100"
        >
          start free on Shopify
        </a>
        <a
          href={WOO_PLUGIN}
          target="_blank"
          rel="external noopener nofollow"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md border border-white/30 bg-transparent px-6 py-3 text-base font-semibold text-white transition hover:border-white hover:bg-white/5"
        >
          start free on WooCommerce
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
